pm_runtime_put_autosuspend(&bh1780->client->dev);
Reason:
The PM runtime reference count acquired by pm_runtime_get_sync() is not released when bh1780_read_word() returns an error, because the put operation is placed after the error check and the function returns prematurely on failure.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
pm_runtime_get_sync(&bh1780->client->dev);
value = bh1780_read_word(bh1780, BH1780_REG_DLOW);
pm_runtime_put_autosuspend(&bh1780->client->dev);
if (value < 0)
